-- ============================================================================
-- EC5 ASSOCIATE DEEP SEED: Capital Portfolio & Cost Control, beginner tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: CHOOSING WHAT TO FUND. Risked EMV, the 0/1 knapsack
-- under a capex limit, the efficient frontier and the grid under the answer.
--
-- THE ENGINE FACT THIS TIER OWNS. The optimal portfolio is solved as a set:
-- ranking projects by risked EMV per million USD picks a worse set, and the
-- optimal sets at two budgets need not be nested.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. Success-case NPV is not value, and a coarse
-- grid can fund a set over the limit (now flagged) or leave a feasible one out.
-- ============================================================================

